    "voice": "produce_events/101800202/1018002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018002020100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いつも健気に頑張るふゆへのお礼を、\r\nまさか自販機の缶コーヒーで済ますつもりじゃないわよね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800202/1018002020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、それは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018002020110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いい豆使って、ふゆのことを心から想いながら淹れて……\r\nそれくらい、トーゼンじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800202/1018002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018002020120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あ、コーヒーには甘いものも必要よね\r\nふゆ、駅前にできたケーキ屋さんのケーキ食べたいな～",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800202/1018002020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "駅前って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nあの、毎朝行列になってるとこのか！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018002020130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いつものお礼、なんて言って\r\nふゆを労うなら、そのくらい当然よねぇ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800202/1018002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018002020140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あ、ふゆはシブーストと、\r\n１日限定５個のフルーツタルトね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
